[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0010","text":"哇……\n夜景好美啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0020","text":"是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0030","text":"那个……不冷吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0040","text":"嗯，没事的\n谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0050","text":"以夜景为背景穿着婚纱拍照，什么的\n总觉得……好厉害啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0060","text":"概念是“崭新的两人”……\n结婚，也许也是一个转折点呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0070","text":"是……是呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0080","text":"不好意思，差不多该准备拍摄了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0090","text":"走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_01_0100","text":"好的……！"}]
